<title>UK: Yieh Phui details $75 million convertible.</title>
<headline>Yieh Phui details $75 million convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust.</p>
<p>ISSUER YIEH PHUI ENTERPRISE CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     1.00	MATURITY   *2007</p>
<p> TYPE **CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES *CALLABLE AT PAR AFTER THREE YEARS SUBJECT TO A 140 PCT</p>
<p>	  HURDLE, AND AFTER FOUR YEARS SUBJECT TO 150 PCT HURDLE.</p>
<p>**THE CONVERSION PRICE IS NT$38.38 PER SHARE, A 7.00 PCT</p>
<p>	  PCT PREMIUM TO SIX-DAY AVERAGE CLOSING.</p>
<p>	  THE FOREX RATE WAS FIXED AT NT$27.891 PER USD, GIVING</p>
<p>	  7,267.0662 SHARES PER $10,000 BOND.</p>
<p>	  THERE IS A $15 MILLION GREENSHOE OPTION.</p>
<p>		-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
